# open-webui writes this secret into cwd if launched from here — never commit it
.webui_secret_key
__pycache__/

# docs/ is its own PRIVATE repo (meatcrowning/nix-docs), synced top<->book by
# home/srvs/nix-docs.nix. Never track it here — this repo is public.
#
# Since 2026-07-27 that includes DESIGN.md and HARDWARE.md, which used to live at
# this root. So the source comments across the panel, the apps, hyprland.lua and
# the AGENTS.md files now cite `docs/DESIGN.md` — a path a fresh clone of THIS
# repo does not contain. That is deliberate and the user's explicit call
# (privacy over self-describing-ness); see docs/README.md. Do not "fix" it by
# moving either file back.
/docs/
